# The root .gitignore drops every image and every build product. This folder is
# the "build + docs" bundle, so the pictures the docs refer to are let back in
# (those under oled_preview/ are the same ones shown in the keymap folder),
# along with the flashable .uf2 and the generated index.html.
#
# The intermediate products stay ignored: .hex / .bin / .elf / .map are derived
# from the same build, are large, and change on every rebuild.
!*.png
!*.gif
!*.uf2
!index.html

# The vector versions of those pictures, and it is the *vector* ones the docs
# link to ("widen it and nothing blurs"): keymap.md, hardware_check.md and
# index.html all point at a .svg next to the .png. The root .gitignore drops
# *.svg, so without these the links are dead on GitHub even though the PNGs
# right beside them are fine.
!keymap_layers.svg
!led_map.svg
!matrix_map_left.svg
!pico_pinout.svg

# The two drawings the snow art was extracted from - make_snow.py reads these
# files, so they are source for oled_snow.h, not decoration.
!oled_snow1.pdf
!oled_snow2.pdf

# The LED effect harness is a host binary (arm64 macOS), not a firmware image:
# rebuild it with `cd led_effects && bash build.sh` instead of committing it.
led_effects/harness
led_effects/*.dSYM/
__pycache__/
